OL,3,GNEWSAAirport recognised for its
OL,4,Asustainability work
OL,5,
OL,6,FJersey Airport has been recognised for
OL,7,Fits efforts to boost sustainability and
OL,8,Freduce carbon emissions.
OL,10,FThe airport has been awarded a Level 4
OL,11,Ftransformation status by Airport Carbon
OL,12,FAccreditation, a global carbon
OL,13,Fmanagement certification programme for
OL,14,Fairports.
OL,16,FPorts of Jersey said the recognition
OL,17,Freflected its commitment to achieve net
OL,18,Fzero Scope 1 and Scope 2 emissions by
OL,19,F2030.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
