OL,3,GNEWSAAirport recognised for its
OL,4,Asustainability work
OL,5,
OL,6,FSophie Alexander, the airport's head of
OL,7,Fsustainability and community, said "it
OL,8,Fwas a huge achievement" which showed "a
OL,9,Ffundamental shift" in the way the site
OL,10,Foperated.
